<title>USA: Champion Industries sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Champion Industries sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGTON, W.Va. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Champion Industries Inc said Monday that its board declared a 25 percent stock dividend to be treated and accounted for as a five-for-four split.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be paid January 27 to shareholders of record January 6, the company said.</p>
<p>Champion said its previously announced regular fourth quarter cash dividend of $0.05 per share will be paid December 23 to shareholders of record December 2.</p>
</text>
